The "solar-system" parallax set (vibeos-launcher/parallax/solar-system), made from NASA images (public domain) and
procedural art drawn by the script:

    python3 -I build_solar_system.py DOWNLOADS ../../vibeos-launcher/parallax/solar-system

DOWNLOADS holds the six NASA originals the set's README lists (with their URLs; nasa_search.py and nasa_item.py
query images.nasa.gov for them). The script needs python3-pil and python3-numpy.
